  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/images.html#update-the-image-data has\n\n> 1\\. Continue running this algorithm **[in parallel](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/infrastructure.html#in-parallel)**.\n> ...\n> 4\\. **[Queue a microtask](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#queue-a-microtask)** to continue this algorithm.\n\nBut [Queue a microtask](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#queue-a-microtask) starts with\n\n> [Assert](https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#assert): there is a [surrounding agent](https://tc39.es/ecma262/#surrounding-agent). I.e., this algorithm is not called while [in parallel](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/infrastructure.html#in-parallel).",
